# Spark's deck, driven by a finger (LLP 1057 §10.6): pans that throw a card
# by where it is or by how fast it goes (panrelease's velocity), one that
# springs home, a super like upwards, a photo tap on a panning node (a press
# without movement, LLP 1057.001 rule 4); the buttons are tapped after.
drag card-top -250 0 200
drag card-top 250 0 200
drag card-top 40 0 500
drag card-top 0 -320 200
tap keep-swiping
tap photo-right
drag card-top 70 0 40
